13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,901
A short optimizer inspection finds the discrepancy. Five
epochs and four minibatches should produce

14
00:01:16,901 --> 00:01:22,801
twenty optimizer steps per update. The faulty configuration
produces only four. These are fresh

15
00:01:22,801 --> 00:01:27,016
