trained checkpoint.

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,346
The registered correction restores the configured epoch
count. The recorded approval chain is

17
00:01:34,346 --> 00:01:39,691
proposed, approved, consumed, then receipt. Training
restarts with a different seed. This replay

18
00:01:39,691 --> 00:01:45,037
