run training.

19
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,954
Recovery is tested separately across twenty six fixed
conditions. The corrected policy's linear

20
00:01:51,954 --> 00:01:58,052
tracking error is zero point one four eight meters per
second, near the normal control. Its

21
00:01:58,052 --> 00:02:01,481
