summary.

22
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,349
A separate compound defect needs another loop. In two
development seeds, the first correction is

23
00:02:11,349 --> 00:02:17,275
insufficient. Both pass after the second correction, in
opposite orders. These are known defect

24
00:02:17,275 --> 00:02:21,931
